---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="How Preorders Work | CUMID" description="Preorder a CUMID pocket diary for ₹149 plus ₹50 shipping per order. Delivery within 14 days of payment confirmation.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 py-12 space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-4"><p class="eyebrow">Made for your next thought</p><h1 class="text-4xl">Your diary, in three steps.</h1><p>₹149 per diary. ₹50 shipping per order. Delivery within 14 days of payment confirmation.</p></header>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl">1. Choose your cover</h2><p>Explore our floral, cute, Hinglish, car, jet and original cover designs. Our current catalogue is open for preorders. These diaries are made to order, with square pocket pages and spiral binding along the top.</p><p class="text-sm">Images are digital cover previews. We share final dimensions, paper and page count before payment.</p></section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl">2. Review your preorder</h2><p>Click Preorder this diary, choose your quantity and enter your name and delivery PIN code. Review your total and purchase terms. One diary totals ₹199 including shipping; two total ₹348.</p><p>Continue on WhatsApp and send the prepared message to +91 9201871597. No account is needed. Opening WhatsApp alone does not send the message or confirm an order.</p></section>
    <section class="space-y-3"><h2 class="text-2xl">3. Confirm and receive</h2><p>We confirm your specifications, delivery serviceability, full address and payment instructions in WhatsApp. After payment is verified, we issue your order reference. Your diary is delivered within 14 calendar days of payment confirmation, including manufacturing and shipping.</p><p>We share tracking when your parcel is dispatched. If there is a material delay, we contact you with the revised timeline and applicable cancellation or refund options.</p></section>
    <p>Never share your UPI PIN or OTP. Questions? Email <a class="underline" href="mailto:support@cumid.store">support@cumid.store</a>.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="btn-primary" href="/shop">Choose a cover</a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/checkout">Start a preorder</a></div>
    <p class="text-sm"><a class="underline" href="/shipping">Shipping</a> · <a class="underline" href="/returns-cancellations">Returns &amp; cancellations</a> · <a class="underline" href="/terms">Terms</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
